# Applied automatically to anyone using -lib hxscript.
#
# Keeps the standard-library types scripts reach by reflection. Dead code elimination decides what to
# strip by what the COMPILED code references, and a script references nothing at compile time, so
# under the default -dce std a member no call site happens to use is removed and a script reaching it
# finds a null field. See docs/embedding.md.
#
# -D hxscript_no_keep turns this off.
--macro hxscript.macro.KeepMacro.run()
